        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/e0b2c6/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-13T23:03:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We've seen Legacy flying outside of Earth's atmosphere (divider card). When did Legacy gain the power of surviving in temperatures well below -100 Celsius, as well as not needing to breathe? He seems pretty comfy up there. Not like he's holding his breath or anything.</p><p>Also, I assume his impenetrable skin works from the inside out as well - is that why he isn't dying from a major case of the bends?</p>",
